Rule 1 (x must have a supported dtype for Sign)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if 1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 4 then true else if 6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8 then true else if 9 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10 then true else false
>>
Rule 2 (x must not be bool or uint8)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 5
>>
Rule 3 (x may have any non-negative rank)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 4 (name is an unconstrained string parameter)
{v_2 : str} |= v_2 = v_2
>>
Rule 5 (each dimension size of x is non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
